# Hub SPA chrome

Prefer existing Hub primitives before adding a parallel toolbar, token, or empty-state dialect. Pointer in `AGENTS.md` (SPA chrome / UX). Sticky / progress details: [`hub-sticky-header.mdc`](hub-sticky-header.mdc), [`hub-progress-bar.mdc`](hub-progress-bar.mdc).

## Share

- Sticky chrome: wrap header + `.hub-progress-host` in `.hub-sticky-chrome`; body (`.db-body`, `.sq-body`, `.dr-body`, `.or-body`) scrolls underneath.
- React progress: `HubProgress.mount(hostEl)` in `useEffect` (`packages/web/src/lib/hub-progress.ts`).
- Tokens / buttons: `--hub-*` and `.hub-btn` aliases in `rayenz-hub/shared/hub-mtg-ui.css`. Settings `packages/web/src/styles.css` should use `--hub-accent`, not a second blue.
- Menus: `DbMenu` / `FiltersMenu`. Active filters: dismissible `ActiveFilterChips` in sticky chrome when Filters ≠ All (`packages/web/src/deck-builder/ui/ActiveFilterChips.tsx`).
- Card density: `CardSizePicker`.
- Empty: dashed `.db-empty-state` (or `.hub-empty`) with a short explanation and **one** CTA. Library (`FormatFilteredLibrary`) and Swap Queue are the templates.
- One status slot under sticky chrome (progress host + a single banner). Do not stack muted / warn / error lines.
- Wishlist is a named Swap Queue mode (`#/wishlist`): mode chips in SQ chrome; Swap Queue nav stays active. Keep share URLs.
- Pair hashes: Builder `#/{commander-builder|cube-builder}/{user}/{deck}/swap/{entryId}`; Swap Queue `#/{swap-queue|wishlist}/{user}/pair/{deckId}/{entryId}`. Secondary actions on `SwapEditChrome`: View in Swap Queue / Open in Builder.
- Overlays: `packages/web/src/ui/useDialogA11y.ts` — Escape, focus trap, restore focus. Nested embedded Scryfall/printing does not get a second trap.
- Builder selection/Trim: Esc, Delete (remove with confirm), T (toggle Trim); one-line hint in sticky chrome when trim or selection is active.

## Toolbar hierarchy

Keep on the strip: Browse / Layout / Sort / Filters / size.

Overflow (hamburger): Categories, Basics, Trim, Glance, copy/export.

- Builder: `packages/web/src/deck-builder/import-export/DeckActionsMenu.tsx`
- Swap Queue: existing actions hamburger

## Nav drawer

`#hub-nav-toggle` in `packages/web/src/hub/HubShell.tsx`: `aria-expanded`, Open/Close `aria-label`, Escape closes and focuses the toggle.

## Keep separate

- Dailies / Neopets More tile canvas (do not restyle to match MTG)
- Suggest / Order Reconcile may keep `dr-*` / `or-*` class names
- Glance packers and product dialogs (see `glance.mdc`)

## Avoid

- Equal-weight primary toolbars (Categories / Trim / Glance as same-weight `db-btn`s beside Browse)
- A second identical FAB while an empty-state CTA is showing
- `HubProgress.finish()` on uneventful list refresh — `dismiss()` on success; `finish({ variant: 'error' })` when the user must see failure
- `position: fixed` headers (use `.hub-sticky-chrome`)
- Dark mode, renaming `dr-*` / `or-*` for consistency, making Dailies look like MTG
